    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41248" root="هفت" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَفَاتٌ</span></b>  <i>Stupid; foolish; of little sense.</i> (S, K.)
[But see its syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَفَاتٌ</span>, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْفَتُ</span>.] Authorities
differ respecting this word and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَفَاتٌ</span>, whether
they should be written with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ت</span> or with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span> or with
both. (TA.)

